          "code": "PARSE_INPUT",
          "id": "1767860068423",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1767860068425_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Input Data: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\nInstructions:\nStrictly follow the steps below to extract and process information:\n\nStep 1: Extract PartyNumber\nIdentify and extract the PartyNumber from the input data.\nAdd the extracted PartyNumber to the output properties.\nPopulate the following object with the extracted PartyNumber:\n\nQExpressionContact = {\n  'op': '$and',\n  'criteria': [\n    {'op': '$eq', 'attribute': 'PartyNumber', 'value': '<ExtractedPartyNumber>'}\n  ]\n}\n\nStep 2: Process Based on Input Data Format\n\n\nIf Input is JSON (e.g., { \"ComprehensiveSummary\": \"Y\", \"PartyNumber\": \"C014\" }):\nIdentify and extract ComprehensiveSummary and BriefSummary from the input data add to output properties.\nTERMINATE;\n\nStep 3 : \nIF user is asking for Comprehensive summary or summary then add below to output\ncomprehensiveSummary = Y\n\nIf user is asking for Brief Summary then add below to output\nBriefSummary = Y"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"BriefSummary\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"ComprehensiveSummary\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"QExpressionContact\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"ExtractedPartyNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "If Summary"
          },
          "outcomes": {
